                "name": "onLeadUpdate",
                "runOn": "OnUpdate",
                "block": "```\nif(!this.hasUnreadInteractions) {\n    this.unreadInteractionsCount = 0;\n} else {\n    if(this.hasUnreadInteractions && (old.lastInteraction != this.lastInteraction)){\n        this.unreadInteractionsCount = this.unreadInteractionsCount + 1;\n    }\n}\n```"
